00:28:14,879 --> 00:28:19,879
手首にブラブラって紐があるんだけど、これね、取れます！
There are these dangling ribbons on my wrists, and these can actually come off!

336
00:28:19,879 --> 00:28:22,879
じゃ、取ってもらおうかな？
Shall I ask them to take them off?

337
00:28:22,879 --> 00:28:24,879
えい！
Ei!

338
00:28:24,879 --> 00:28:26,879
ということで、
And so,

339
00:28:26,879 --> 00:28:30,379
はい、取れます！
yes, they're off!

340
00:28:30,379 --> 00:28:33,879
こちらバージョンもスクショ撮ってもらおう！
Let's get some screenshots of this version too!

341
00:28:33,879 --> 00:28:35,879
えい！
Ei!

342
00:28:35,879 --> 00:28:37,879
可愛いですか？
Is it cute?

343
00:28:37,879 --> 00:28:41,879
ね、すごい可愛らしい衣装！
Yeah, it's such a lovely outfit!

344
00:28:41,879 --> 00:28:45,879
ちょっとね、ドキドキするんですが、
I'm a bit nervous, but...

345
00:28:45,879 --> 00:28:49,879
いやあ、なんか…でも、ちょっと1人は寂しいな。
Man, somehow... being here alone feels a bit lonely.

346
00:28:49,879 --> 00:28:52,879
なんか、ダインさん…
Like, Dain-san...

347
00:28:52,879 --> 00:28:55,379
あ、あれ可愛い！
Ah, look at that cute thing!

348
00:28:55,379 --> 00:28:58,879
お、なんかウズムズしてる。どうしたどうした？
Oh, he's squirming around. What's wrong, what's wrong?

349
00:28:58,879 --> 00:29:01,379
きゃー！
Kyaa!

350
00:29:01,379 --> 00:29:04,879
ダインさん飛んできたー！
Dain-san flew over to me!

351
00:29:04,879 --> 00:29:10,379
そんなにノエルちゃんに会いたかったのかな？可愛いね！
Did you want to see Noel-chan that much? So cute!

352
00:29:10,379 --> 00:29:13,379
いっぱいスクショ撮れた？
Were you able to take lots of screenshots?

353
00:29:13,379 --> 00:29:16,879
ダインさんとのツーショット！
A two-shot with Dain-san!

354
00:29:16,879 --> 00:29:18,879
可愛い！
So cute!

355
00:29:18,879 --> 00:29:20,379
え、なに？
Huh, what is it?

356
00:29:20,379 --> 00:29:25,879
あ、今日は「安眠」テーマで、心地が良い？なるほどね。
Ah, today's theme is "sound sleep", so it feels cozy? I see.

357
00:29:25,879 --> 00:29:27,879
ん？曲のリクエスト？
Hm? A song request?

358
00:29:27,879 --> 00:29:31,879
子守唄みたいな曲が聴きたい？あ、そうなの、ダインさん？
You want to hear a lullaby-like song? Ah, is that so, Dain-san?

359
00:29:31,879 --> 00:29:36,879
じゃあせっかくね、ダインさん来てくれたし、
Well then, since Dain-san is here with us,

360
00:29:36,879 --> 00:29:40,879
一緒に、じゃあ子守唄を…
let me sing a lullaby for you together...

361
00:29:40,879 --> 00:29:43,879
うん、歌うよ！歌う！だからちょっと付いてきて！
Yep, I'll sing! I'll sing! So come along with me!

362
00:29:43,879 --> 00:29:46,379
一緒に、行くよー！
Here we go together!

363
00:29:46,379 --> 00:29:48,879
お、おらい！
Alright!

364
00:29:42,879 --> 00:29:47,079
小さな人の子よ
Little child of man,

365
00:29:47,079 --> 00:29:55,879
森へ迷い込んだ
who strayed into the forest.

366
00:30:01,198 --> 00:30:08,998
大きなこの翼が ぼうやは見えないのね
You can't see these large wings, can you, little boy?

367
00:30:10,698 --> 00:30:22,398
なにも知らない まあるいほっぺよ
Oh, those round little cheeks that know nothing at all...

368
00:30:23,198 --> 00:30:29,698
ねむれや ねむれ
Sleep now, sleep...

369
00:30:30,998 --> 00:30:36,698
しずかな水辺においで
Come on down by the quiet waterside.

370
00:30:37,198 --> 00:30:43,398
ぼうやの夢は
Your dreams...

371
00:30:44,198 --> 00:30:50,398
竜の背に運ばれて
will be carried upon a dragon's back...

372
00:30:51,198 --> 00:30:57,698
山の向こうへ消える
to disappear beyond the mountains.

373
00:31:14,398 --> 00:31:27,998
よろずの子らも ならんでねむる
All the many children sleep side by side.

374
00:31:28,998 --> 00:31:42,698
七つ数えたら 仲良くねむっていく
When I count to seven, they peacefully fall asleep together.

375
00:31:47,198 --> 00:31:59,698
なにも見えない 小さなおめめよ
Oh, those tiny eyes that can see nothing at all...

376
00:32:00,198 --> 00:32:06,698
ねむれや ねむれ
Sleep now, sleep...

377
00:32:07,198 --> 00:32:13,398
そよぐ草むらへおいで
Come on down to the swaying grass.

378
00:32:14,198 --> 00:32:20,698
ぼうやの夢は
Your dreams...

379
00:32:22,198 --> 00:32:28,398
母さんを探しては
will search for your mother...

380
00:32:29,198 --> 00:32:35,398
空の向こうへ帰る
and return to a place beyond the sky.

381
00:32:36,198 --> 00:32:42,398
竜の背に運ばれて
Carried upon a dragon's back...

382
00:32:43,198 --> 00:32:50,198
山の向こうへ消える
they will disappear beyond the mountains.

383
00:33:07,198 --> 00:33:12,198
プラネタリウム
[Planetarium]

384
00:33:31,198 --> 00:33:40,398
夕月夜 顔だす 消えてく子供の声
The evening moon reveals itself as children's voices fade away.

385
00:33:41,198 --> 00:33:50,398
遠く遠く この空のどこかに 君はいるんだろう
Far, far away, somewhere in this sky, you must be there.

386
00:33:51,198 --> 00:34:03,398
夏の終わりの2人で抜け出した この公園で見つけた
At the end of summer, the two of us snuck out and found it in this park.

387
00:34:04,198 --> 00:34:09,698
あの星座 何だか覚えてる？
Do you remember what that constellation was?

388
00:34:10,198 --> 00:34:19,398
会えなくても 記憶をたどって 同じ幸せを見たいんだ
Even if we can't meet, I trace my memories, wanting to see the same happiness.

389
00:34:20,198 --> 00:34:27,398
あの香りとともに 花火がぱっと開く
Along with that familiar scent, fireworks burst open.

390
00:34:28,198 --> 00:34:38,398
行きたいよ 君のところへ 今すぐかけだして行きたいよ
I want to go to you, I want to start running toward you right now.

391
00:34:39,198 --> 00:34:47,398
まっ暗で 何も見えない 怖くても大丈夫
It's pitch black and I can't see anything, but even if it's scary, I'm okay.

392
00:34:48,198 --> 00:34:57,698
数えきれない星空が 今もずっとここにあるんだよ
The endless starry sky is still right here, even now.

393
00:34:58,198 --> 00:35:01,198
泣かないよ
I won't cry.

394
00:35:01,319 --> 00:35:06,819
泣かないよ 君と見た 綺麗な空だったから
I won't cry, because it was a beautiful sky I saw with you.

395
00:35:15,919 --> 00:35:25,119
あの遠くまで響く靴の音が耳に残る
The sound of footsteps echoing far away lingers in my ears.

396
00:35:25,819 --> 00:35:34,819
大きな自分の影を見つめて想うのでしょう
Gazing at my own long shadow, I wonder.

397
00:35:35,319 --> 00:35:44,319
ちっとも変わらないはずなのに 切ない気持ちふくらんでく
Though nothing should have changed, a bittersweet feeling grows.

398
00:35:44,819 --> 00:35:52,819
どんなに想ったって君はもういない
No matter how much I long for you, you're no longer here.

399
00:35:54,119 --> 00:36:02,819
行きたいよ 君のそばに 小さくても小さくても
I want to be by your side, even if I'm small, even if I'm small.

400
00:36:03,319 --> 00:36:12,519
1番に君が好きだよ 強く居られる
You are my absolute favorite, it lets me stay strong.

401
00:36:13,119 --> 00:36:22,319
願いを流れ星に そっと唱えてみたけれど
I softly whispered a wish to a shooting star, but...

402
00:36:23,119 --> 00:36:32,319
泣かないよ 届くだろう 綺麗な空に
I won't cry, it will reach up into this beautiful sky.

403
00:36:50,119 --> 00:36:58,819
会えなくても記憶をたどって 同じ幸せが見たいんだ
Even if we can't meet, I trace my memories, wanting to see the same happiness.

404
00:36:59,319 --> 00:37:07,819
あの香りとともに花火がぱっと開く
Along with that scent, fireworks burst brightly into bloom.

405
00:37:08,319 --> 00:37:17,319
行きたいよ 君のところへ 小さな手を握りしめて
I want to go to you, holding onto your small hand.

406
00:37:17,819 --> 00:37:27,119
泣きたいよ それはそれは綺麗な空だった
I want to cry, it was such a truly beautiful sky.

407
00:37:27,819 --> 00:37:36,819
願いを流れ星に そっと唱えてみたけれど
I softly whispered a wish to a shooting star, but...

408
00:37:37,319 --> 00:37:52,319
泣きたいよ 届かない想いをこの空に...
I want to cry, sending my unreachable feelings into this sky...

409
00:39:04,819 --> 00:39:09,519
もう何十回 もう何百回も 震むソラ見上げて
Dozens of times, hundreds of times, looking up at the trembling sky

410
00:39:09,819 --> 00:39:14,519
辿り着いた場所が 運命のダイヤモンド
The place we finally reached is the diamond of destiny

411
00:39:15,119 --> 00:39:20,519
何千回 もう何万回も 涙流したきみへ
Thousands of times, tens of thousands of times, to you who shed tears

412
00:39:20,819 --> 00:39:25,119
ねぇ 諦められたことはあったっけ？
Hey, was there ever anything you actually gave up on?

413
00:39:25,319 --> 00:39:30,519
「憧れ＝限界」だから もういらないよ
"Admiration = limits," so I don't need that anymore

414
00:39:30,819 --> 00:39:35,519
そこに留まるなんて もったいないでしょ？
Staying stuck there would be such a waste, right?

415
00:39:36,119 --> 00:39:41,319
それぞれの物語 交差する瞬間を
The moment where each of our stories cross paths

416
00:39:41,519 --> 00:39:46,319
見つめる意味は
The meaning of staring at it is...

417
00:39:47,819 --> 00:39:52,519
放った夢だけ 大きな弧を描いて
Only the dreams we released trace a great arc

418
00:39:52,819 --> 00:39:57,119
はち切れそうな 煌めきを
A sparkle that feels ready to burst forth

419
00:39:57,319 --> 00:40:02,319
消えることなく どこまでも
Without ever disappearing, endlessly onward

420
00:40:02,279 --> 00:40:05,979
世界の向こうに 届けよう
Let's deliver it to the other side of the world!

421
00:40:05,979 --> 00:40:10,279
終わることのない この胸の衝動は
This endless impulse in my chest

422
00:40:10,279 --> 00:40:15,679
どうしたって どうしても ぼくを呼んでいたから
was calling out to me no matter what.

423
00:40:15,679 --> 00:40:21,879
その先へと 走り続ける
I will keep running beyond that,

424
00:40:21,879 --> 00:40:27,179
次へ 次へ
onward to the next, onward to the next!

425
00:41:04,979 --> 00:41:10,179
妄想だった 中途半端な ふがいなさ抱えて
Holding onto my halfway, pathetic delusions,

426
00:41:10,179 --> 00:41:15,179
立ち尽くしていた 通り雨は プレリュード
I stood frozen; the passing shower was a prelude.

427
00:41:15,179 --> 00:41:21,179
何千回 もう何万回も 挑み続けたきみへ
To you who kept trying thousands, tens of thousands of times,

428
00:41:21,179 --> 00:41:25,679
ねぇ 聴かせてよ 「夢は叶うんだ」って
hey, let me hear you say, "Dreams do come true."

429
00:41:25,679 --> 00:41:31,179
「諦め＝敗北」ならば 絶対にないよ
If "giving up equals defeat," then I definitely won't.

430
00:41:31,179 --> 00:41:36,179
だれに邪魔されようと ためらわないで
No matter who gets in the way, don't hesitate,

431
00:41:36,179 --> 00:41:42,179
託された情熱を 落とさずにつないでく
pass on the passion entrusted to us without dropping it.

432
00:41:42,179 --> 00:41:47,179
そう 最後まで
Yes, until the very end!

433
00:41:47,179 --> 00:41:52,679
フラッグに誓い 雄々しくはためいて
Swearing to the flag, fluttering bravely,

434
00:41:52,679 --> 00:41:58,179
鳴り止まない ファンファーレ
a fanfare that never stops ringing

435
00:41:58,179 --> 00:42:02,179
いつも心に 流れていた
was always flowing in my heart,

436
00:42:02,179 --> 00:42:06,179
遠い未来へ 祈るよう
like a prayer for the distant future.

437
00:42:06,179 --> 00:42:10,679
忘れられない あの日々の後悔を
The unforgettable regrets of those days,

438
00:42:10,679 --> 00:42:17,179
追いかけて 追いかけて 滑り込んだ この想い
chasing and chasing after them, these feelings slid into place

439
00:42:17,179 --> 00:42:22,179
青いソラに ふと溢れていった
and suddenly overflowed into the blue sky,

440
00:42:22,179 --> 00:42:28,679
遠く 遠く
far away, far away.

441
00:42:47,179 --> 00:42:53,679
トレビアンナイト
[Title: Très Bien Night]

442
00:42:54,179 --> 00:42:57,979
終わらない 終わらない 仕事が山積み 終わらない
Never-ending, never-ending, work is piling up, never-ending!

443
00:42:57,979 --> 00:43:01,179
止まらない 止まらない それでも時間は 止まらない
Won't stop, won't stop, even so, time won't stop!

444
00:43:01,179 --> 00:43:04,979
Yo Yo! ヘトヘト 溜まり溜まったヘトヘト
Yo Yo! Exhausted, accumulated exhaustion!

445
00:43:04,979 --> 00:43:08,679
電バット 使い古すバット コンボ メイスに 金属バット
Stun bat, worn-out bat, combo mace and metal bat!

446
00:43:08,679 --> 00:43:11,679
今日も精一杯 今日も精一杯
Giving my all again today, giving my all again today!

447
00:43:11,679 --> 00:43:15,679
No More 無知 ギミギミ重視 I see
No more ignorance, prioritizing give & take, I see!

448
00:43:15,679 --> 00:43:18,679
奔走 Anytime 奔走 Anytime
Running around anytime, running around anytime!

449
00:43:18,679 --> 00:43:22,679
はぁーあ ハメ手プレスでエネルギースカスカ パッション
Sigh... drained of energy from constant pressure, passion!

450
00:43:22,679 --> 00:43:26,179
自分自身に 厳しすぎちゃう
Being way too hard on myself...

451
00:43:26,179 --> 00:43:30,179
すぐさまヘラヘラ優等生 さっぱり足りない順応性
Instantly acting like a smiling honor student, completely lacking adaptability.

452
00:43:30,179 --> 00:43:33,179
自分自身としっかり向き合う
Firmly face yourself!

453
00:43:33,179 --> 00:43:36,679
一番 必要な ものは
The thing you need the most is...

454
00:43:36,679 --> 00:43:40,679
トレビアン ご褒美 頂戴 Wahhh
Très bien! Give me a reward, Wahhh!

455
00:43:40,679 --> 00:43:43,979
てんてこ舞うようなリズムにバイバイしちゃえ
Say goodbye to this frantic, hectic rhythm!

456
00:43:43,979 --> 00:43:47,679
ドレミファの音にご覧 Wahhh
Just look at the Do-Re-Mi-Fa melody, Wahhh!

457
00:43:47,679 --> 00:43:52,179
ぎゅうぎゅう詰めちゃダメ どんどんフリーダム
Don't cram everything in, get more and more freedom!

458
00:43:56,679 --> 00:43:58,679
オーライ オーライ
All right, all right!

459
00:43:58,679 --> 00:44:02,179
好きなもの食べ放題 大きくします胸の内
All-you-can-eat of your favorite things, expanding my heart's desires!

460
00:44:02,179 --> 00:44:05,679
これもっともっと頂戴 頂大 Get ready
Give me more and more of this, give me more, get ready!

461
00:44:05,679 --> 00:44:09,179
辛抱多めですたまに空回り
Lots of patience, sometimes spinning my wheels,

462
00:44:09,179 --> 00:44:13,179
満ちた日こそ胸張り大盛り
on fulfilled days, puff out your chest with an extra serving!

463
00:44:13,179 --> 00:44:16,679
いらないまやかしの甘やかし
Don't need fake coddling!

464
00:44:16,679 --> 00:44:20,179
ハッピーになるため歌おう声高らかに Yay
Let's sing out loud to be happy, Yay!

465
00:44:20,179 --> 00:44:23,179
自分自身がやっぱり一番
Being true to yourself is after all number one.

466
00:44:23,179 --> 00:44:27,179
理性と欲望が平行線 望みは幸せエンドレス
Reason and desire on parallel lines, my wish is endless happiness!

467
00:44:27,179 --> 00:44:30,679
自分自身としっかり向き合う
Face yourself firmly!

468
00:44:30,679 --> 00:44:34,179
我慢は体に毒だよ
Holding back is poison for your body!

469
00:44:34,179 --> 00:44:38,179
トレビアン ご褒美 頂戴 Wahhh
Très bien! Give me a reward, Wahhh!

470
00:44:38,179 --> 00:44:41,679
てんてこ舞うようなリズムにバイバイしちゃえ
Say goodbye to this frantic rhythm!

471
00:44:41,679 --> 00:44:45,179
ドレミファの音にご覧 Wahhh
Just look at the Do-Re-Mi-Fa melody, Wahhh!

472
00:44:45,179 --> 00:44:49,179
ぎゅうぎゅう詰めちゃダメ どんどんフリーダム
Don't cram everything in, get more and more freedom!

473
00:44:54,179 --> 00:44:56,179
いち にの さん はい！
One, two, three, go!

474
00:44:56,179 --> 00:45:02,179
窮屈なスーツに疲弊社交ストレス 状態異常系から解放
Exhausted in tight suits, social stress—liberated from all status ailments!

475
00:45:03,265 --> 00:45:06,165
もっともっともっともっと まだまだ足りない
More, more, more, more, it's still not enough!

476
00:45:06,465 --> 00:45:09,765
本日は欲望解放パーティナイ
Tonight is a desire-unleashing party night!

477
00:45:09,765 --> 00:45:10,865
乾杯！
Cheers!

478
00:45:11,365 --> 00:45:15,365
トレビアンなご褒美 頂戴
Give me a très bien reward!

479
00:45:15,765 --> 00:45:19,465
てんてこ舞うようなリズムに バイバイしちゃえ
Say bye-bye to this hectic rhythm!

480
00:45:19,765 --> 00:45:22,865
トレビアンな濃厚にご覧
Behold this très bien richness!

481
00:45:23,065 --> 00:45:27,165
ぎゅぎゅっと詰めたから どんどんフリーダム
Packed tight, so it's more and more freedom!

482
00:45:36,665 --> 00:45:40,865
ぎゅぎゅっと目のご褒美 どんどん好きになる
A feast for the eyes packed tight, I like it more and more!

483
00:46:03,465 --> 00:46:06,165
輝夜の城で踊りたい
[I Want to Dance in Kaguya's Castle]

484
00:46:13,865 --> 00:46:16,865
おいで！おいで！ 誘惑の Dance again
Come on! Come on! Tempting dance again!

485
00:46:16,865 --> 00:46:21,165
おいでよおいで！ 輝夜の城へ
Come on, come on! To Kaguya's castle!

486
00:46:21,165 --> 00:46:24,765
出逢いがあやつるミステリー
An encounter manipulating mystery,

487
00:46:24,765 --> 00:46:28,165
危険なペルソナ
a dangerous persona!

488
00:46:28,165 --> 00:46:31,465
踊ろう！踊ろう！ 終わらない Dance beat
Let's dance! Let's dance! An endless dance beat!

489
00:46:31,465 --> 00:46:35,465
踊ろうよ踊ろう！ 輝夜の城で
Let's dance, let's dance! At Kaguya's castle!

490
00:46:35,465 --> 00:46:39,165
夜空を切りとるレーザービーム
Laser beams cutting through the night sky,

491
00:46:39,165 --> 00:46:42,665
私を見てよ？
won't you look at me?

492
00:46:42,665 --> 00:46:46,265
まばゆい星が照らす想い
Dazzling stars light up my feelings,

493
00:46:46,265 --> 00:46:49,965
今宵の夢よ永遠に
tonight's dream, last forever!

494
